# Cistern Hall (CIPlay cistern_hall): the intake, the ledger, the smelter workshop (electric smelter), the valve
# gallery's air, the valve log (the evidence: the plan's rookery rule and this island's end), the gallery chest
# (advanced biofuel extractor), the old pump and its camera, its plate, the pump house locker (advanced anchor), the
# drawer; the treasure.
# offset 0 0 is a placeholder: phase 2 sets it from the recipe's save log (PLAY_FORMAT: Coordinates).
island Cistern Hall
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Evidence
zone intake
expect step 1
read Cistern ledger
expect step 2
open Smelter workshop
wait 3
expect step 3
zone valve_gallery
air valve_gallery
air gallery_air2
expect step 4
read Valve log
expect step 5
open Valve gallery chest
wait 3
expect step 6
zone old_pump
wait 6
expect step 7
read Builder's plate
expect step 8
open Pump house locker
wait 3
expect step 9
zone aqueduct_hill
expect step 10
read Waterman's diary
expect step 11
open Records van's crate
wait 3
expect step 12
open Councillor's drawer
wait 3
expect done
dig
